===Quotations===
{{rfc}}

 "By the bye, I've been thinking of brining out that piece of yours on her bespeak night."
 "When?", asked Nicholas
 "The night of her bespeak. Her benefit night. When her friends and patrons bespeak the play."
 "Oh! I understand", replied Nicholas
 (from ''Nicholas Nickleby'' by Charles Dickens, 1839)

